// OneNetworkIcon, BookMeIcon, MoneyStreamIcon, SocialRewardsIcon,
// CashbackIcon, VaultsIcon, BillingIcon, OpportunitiesIcon, SettingsIcon) are
// not used by this port and are intentionally left out.

